# Mutation plan for plugin installation (plugin_install.go, extract_plugin_tar.go, syncPlugins).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-install.plan
#
# The unit lines are judged by plugin_install::go_parity, which runs Go's own extractTarGz over
# the same corpus; the api lines by parity::plugin_statuses, whose host installs from the file
# store. Not planned: the setuid bit, which both walks mask off. CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.
#
# 2026-09-18: 15 run, 12 caught; both controls survived. install-never-activates SURVIVED and is
# owed, not equivalent: at start-up syncPluginsActiveState activates straight after the sync, so
# only an install after start-up (POST /plugins) can see it. Re-run it with that route's suite.

